WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.159 --> 00:00:08.910
If you had purchased the computing power found
inside an iPhone 5S in 1992, it would have

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:18.250
cost you $3.56 million.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.519
Lenin owned nine Rolls-Royces.

00:00:22.519 --> 00:00:29.070
Humans spend 13% of their lives not focusing
on anything in particular.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:34.590
Fishing lakes in remote areas of California
are stocked by throwing baby trout out of

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:39.430
planes flying over the water at 200 mph.

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:45.160
There is more water in the Earth's core than
in all of its oceans.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:50.910
Prisoners waiting to be executed on Death
Row in America are given a physical beforehand,

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:54.640
to ensure they are fit enough to die.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:01:01.899
Until 1916, cocaine and heroin could be bought
over the counter at Harrods.

00:01:01.899 --> 00:01:09.760
Kevin Kadish, the co-writer of “All About
That Bass”, has only received $5,679 from

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:14.870
178 million plays of the song on streaming
services.

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:23.210
That's roughly $0.00003 per stream.

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:30.580
In 117 ad, Emperor Hadrian declared attempted
suicide by soldiers, a form of desertion and

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:33.050
made it a capital offence.

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:38.860
The ancient Greek philosopher Heraclitus attempted
to cure a serious illness by lying in the

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:41.340
sun covered in cow dung.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:45.360
He died the following day.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:51.270
Prison inmates in Chile have better mental
health than the average American.

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:56.950
The theoretical process of knocking a meteoroid
of course with a nuclear explosion is called

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.390
an 'X-ray slap'.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:05.340
Four million years ago, rats in South America
were the size of hippos.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:13.330
The Pentagon is successfully hacked 250,000
times a year, and unsuccessfully hacked 10

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:15.790
million times a day.

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:21.840
A whole orange will float on water, but it
sinks if you peel it.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:32.060
Stephen Hawking was born exactly 300 years,
to the day, after Galileo died.

